      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Elegant 5 Bedroom Townhouse, Town Centre Location, c.187sq.mts."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "The property dates to 1850, having a kerb-side presence, with a Southern southerly aspect..\r\nThe residence featuring 5 Bedrooms and 2 Bathrooms, offers  a homely ambiance that contrasts with the buzz of the adjacent street.\r\nRadiant with light and air, high ceilings, large window frames, the overall feeling is one of \"quiet luxury\" within a bustling town.\r\nAccommodation comprises of a most impressive Entrance Hall, 2 Reception rooms,  large Kitchen, Storage, WC, on the ground floor\r\nThe First Floor has 4 Bedrooms, Main Bathroom, numerous storage spaces, good sized Landing\r\nThe Second Floor has a full size attic bedroom ( potential to divide into 2 ) and a very large storage area..\r\nThe garden to the rear is the jewel in the crown ! everyone loves to have a garden in the centre of town.\r\nIt runs the length of College Street and meets the Community College Carpark,, 5 minute extra lie-in in the morning. for students, out the back gate ! \r\nEasily maintained, it features 2 laden down apple trees, along with very colourful planting.throughout.\r\nAt the end of the garden, there is an off-street garage for safe parking. or storage.\r\nServices : Mains Sewage, Mains Water, OFCH.\r\n\r\nThe beautiful West Cork coastline is within easy reach, with Inchydoney Beach, Red Strand, Owenahincha and a variety of scenic coastal walks all just a short drive away. Cork Airport is a 50 minute drive away..The vibrant town of Clonakilty is renowned for its friendly community, excellent schools, and lively cultural scene, including festivals, music, and artisan foods.\r\nDisclaimer: All information provided is to the best of our knowledge but is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No warranties or representations are made regarding the accuracy, completeness, condition or planning status of the property. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of all information provided, including measurements, boundaries, size or acreage, BER details and services. All measurements and distances are approximate and for guidance only. Photographs and video are for illustrative purposes and may include items not included in the sale (e.g. furniture)."
      },
